# Music sources. The game ships anonymous, heavily filtered track-NN.mp3
# files (see assets/_audio-transcode/transcode-music.sh). The full-quality
# originals stay OUT of the repository - they are copyrighted recordings,
# their filenames and ID3 tags name the songs, and they are 37 MB. The
# track-mapping.txt that says which track-NN is which song lives in there
# too, and is excluded for the same reason.
triageRush/assets/audio/_originals-untreated/

# The bitrate/filter listening test that chose the recipe. Its clips are
# unfiltered excerpts and the page names the song, so it stays local. Keep
# it as your own reference; regenerate it any time from the originals.
_mockups/audio-bitrate-test/
_mockups/audio-bitrate-test.html
